  "releaseNotes": "Join me on Developer Thoughts, https://egvijayanand.in/, an exclusive blog for .NET MAUI and Blazor.\n\nWhat's new in ver. 3.5.0:\n-------------------------\nAn extended ObservableRangeCollection<T> type that allows adding, replacing, and removing multiple items at once from the ObservableCollection<T> type.\n\nThe IDataStore<T> interface has been updated to support a generic ID type, allowing the use of identifier type beyond just string.\n\nv3.4.0:\n\nPackage suite update.\n\nv3.3.0:\n\nPackage suite update.\n\nv3.2.0:\n\nJSON serializer extension methods.\n\nv3.1.0:\n\nPackage suite update.\n\nv3.0.0:\n\nThe version of the package is released on top of .NET 8 RTM.\n\n3.0.0-rc.2.2:\n\nThe version of the package was released on top of .NET 8 RC2.\n\nv3.0.0-rc.2.1:\n\nThe version of the package was released on top of .NET 8 RC2.\n\nv3.0.0-rc.2:\n\nThe version of the package was released on top of .NET 8 RC2.\n\nv3.0.0-rc.1:\n\nThe version of the package was released on top of .NET 8 RC1.\n\nv3.0.0-preview.7:\n\nThe version of the package was released on top of .NET 8 Preview 7.\n\nv3.0.0-preview.1:\n\nInitial release built on top of .NET 8 Preview.\n\nAdditional properties defined in the IViewModel interface and BaseViewModel type.",
